# security/signing.env -- live-only-in-spirit config for the signed-manifest
# integrity system (see ctdi-dispatch-internal's docs/COMPLIANCE_SECURITY.md
# "Signed Manifest Integrity" section for the full design/threat model this
# mirrors -- same mechanism, applied to this repo's own tree).
#
# This is the operator's own key fingerprint for this repo -- the same GPG
# key already used for signed commits (git config user.signingkey) and for
# ctdi-dispatch-internal's identical mechanism. Never hardcode a fingerprint
# directly in sign-manifest.sh/verify-manifest.sh; always read it from here.
SIGNING_KEY_FINGERPRINT=3B29752DACA3544CEA60D01A7B81F49CD96C1631
